      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Hedge execution (W3412); month-end close (links to VS-17.1/W9A)
Frequency: Monthly + at hedge event
Volume: All active hedges
Owner: Finance Controller
Participants: Finance Controller, Treasury Manager, External Audit (links to VS-21), CFO
Source: workflow W3413 — Hedge Accounting (PFRS 9), Effectiveness &amp; Mark-to-Market Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
