        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-70 (ensure commodity exposure &amp; hedge accounting accuracy.) | - operational: robust documentation and testing; operational: finance/audit review
Owner: Finance Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
