      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Index movement (W3403); contract re-price frequency (W3411)
Frequency: Monthly/quarterly per contract
Volume: ~50–100 indexed contracts
Owner: Category Manager
Participants: Category Manager, Procurement, Vendor, Finance (links to VS-15/VS-85), Master Data (links to VS-29)
Source: workflow W3414 — Vendor Raw-Material Surcharge &amp; Formula-Price Administration</bpmn:documentation>
