        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3414_Start4" name="Index movement (W3403); contract re-price frequency (W3411)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3414_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3414_Task5" name="Category Managers/Procurement compute the formula price/surcharge per indexed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Category Managers/Procurement compute the formula price/surcharge per indexed contract (W3411) using the latest index (W3403), contract formula, cap/floor, and raw-material weight; validate against market benchmark and vendor submission
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Procurement
Accountable (A): Procurement Director
Duration: Monthly/Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3414_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3414_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3414_Task6" name="Finance/Master Data update the item cost and SRP impact (links to W289 pricing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/Master Data update the item cost and SRP impact (links to W289 pricing master, VS-85 costing, VS-01.2 price management) in the ERP; AP picks up the new cost on subsequent invoices (links to VS-15.1); document the change and audit trail
Responsible (R): Finance / Master Data / AP
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly/Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3414_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3414_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3414_Task7" name="Category Managers monitor vendor compliance with the formula (asymmetric…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Category Managers monitor vendor compliance with the formula (asymmetric pass-through, lagging reductions, surcharge creep), dispute deviations, and feed patterns to contract renewal (links to VS-03.3/W3415) and pass-through analytics (W3417)
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Procurement
Accountable (A): Procurement Director
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3414_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3414_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3414_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3414_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
