    <bpmn:process id="W_W3416" name="W3416. Hedge &amp; Mitigation Performance Review and Strategy Adjustment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly governance review (links to W3406)
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Full hedge/mitigation portfolio
Owner: CFO
Participants: CFO, Treasury Manager, Procurement Director, FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Risk (links to VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W3416 — Hedge &amp; Mitigation Performance Review and Strategy Adjustment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3416_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3416_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3416_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3416_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3416_Lane2" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3416_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3416_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3416_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3416_Start4" name="Monthly/quarterly governance review (links to W3406)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3416_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3416_Task5" name="Treasury/Procurement compile mitigation performance: hedge MTM/settlement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/Procurement compile mitigation performance: hedge MTM/settlement (W3412/W3413), forward-buy realized margin (W3410), indexed-contract price outcome vs market (W3411/W3414), LTSA performance (W3415), and the net margin-protection vs the no-mitigation counterfactual
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / Procurement / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3416_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3416_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3416_Task6" name="CFO/Treasury evaluate strategy effectiveness vs objectives and risk appetite…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CFO/Treasury evaluate strategy effectiveness vs objectives and risk appetite (W3406): hedge-ratio adequacy, basis risk, opportunity cost, and lessons; recommend strategy adjustments (ratio, instrument, vendor clause, LTSA)
Responsible (R): CFO / Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3416_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3416_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3416_Task7" name="CFO report mitigation performance and strategy to the executive committee…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO report mitigation performance and strategy to the executive committee (links to VS-33.2) and Audit Committee/Board (links to VS-36); ensure alignment with margin/EBITDA narrative (links to VS-101.3/VS-17.4) and approve program updates
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): Board / Audit Committee
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3416_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3416_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3416_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3416_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3416_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-548 (ensure controlled execution — Procurement Hedging, Forward Buying &amp; Indexed-Pricing Strategy (PA-106.2).) | - operational: objective benchmark and audit; operational: quarterly review and trigger-based adjustment
Owner: CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
